OL,3,GNEWSAChild taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fafter a hit-and-run in Armagh.
OL,9,FThe incident, involving a boy and a
OL,10,Fsilver Volkswagen Golf, happened on the
OL,11,FNewry Road at about 14:30 GMT on
OL,12,FSaturday.
OL,14,FOfficers from the Police Service of
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) and Northern
OL,16,FIreland Ambulance Service attended the
OL,17,Fscene and the young boy's injuries are
OL,18,Fnot believed to be life-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
