OL,3,GNEWSAChild taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Bigger from the PSNI said: "We're
OL,7,Fkeen to speak to anyone who witnessed
OL,8,Fthe collision to get in touch with us,
OL,9,Fincluding the driver of the Golf."
